      ],
      "en": "“When Israel was a child, then I loved him, and called my son out of Egypt.",
      "ko": "이스라엘의 어렸을 때에 내가 사랑하여 내 아들을 애굽에서 불러 내었거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "8eb1fab27fcf33ba4b4f63c82a110beb573202adf711fc42c27dbbb98b1dcea8",
      "translation_text_hash": "912bfb3cb916e178d5814efa02e3cf7bf678663b5e9333c85c86e3fbc24a972f",
