        {
          "book": "HOS",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "They called to them, so they went from them. They sacrificed to the Baals, and burned incense to engraved images.",
      "ko": "선지자들이 저희를 부를수록 저희가 점점 멀리하고 바알들에게 제사하며 아로새긴 우상 앞에서 분향하였느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "a51f299415b0f4ccb4f2b60919c8e6e31938ed5801ee62c1b9f999c526bba5fe",
      "translation_text_hash": "2dfe1ca7bbce9ab432c31041b7de906ef3cb2f8ec58eaa6aea1ad4c5e1bdc36a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "선지자들이 저희를 부를수록 저희가 점점 멀리하고 바알들에게 제사하며 아로새긴 우상 앞에서 분향하였느니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2dfe1ca7bbce9ab432c31041b7de906ef3cb2f8ec58eaa6aea1ad4c5e1bdc36a"
